00:09:39.667 --> 00:09:42.667
helping us tackle this crisis

00:09:42.836 --> 00:09:45.836
with the urgency it demands.

00:09:46.507 --> 00:09:47.175
With its passage we will be

00:09:47.175 --> 00:09:47.875
able to quickly open first

00:09:47.875 --> 00:09:49.875
responder friendly treatment

00:09:50.945 --> 00:09:51.679
sites like a22 garry and add

00:09:51.679 --> 00:09:54.415
much needed treatment beds for

00:09:54.415 --> 00:09:55.116
those struggling with severe

00:09:55.116 --> 00:09:57.516
mental illness and addiction.

00:09:58.919 --> 00:09:59.620
This legislation also allows us

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:02.200
to streamline procurement of

00:10:02.122 --> 00:10:02.856
these sites and hire essential

00:10:02.856 --> 00:10:05.727
public health workers and where

00:10:05.727 --> 00:10:06.327
necessary law enforcement to

00:10:06.327 --> 00:10:08.327
strengthen our response

00:10:09.697 --> 00:10:10.398
alongside our enforcement work

00:10:10.398 --> 00:10:11.320
to stop the sale of deadly

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:13.234
fentanyl in our streets.

00:10:13.234 --> 00:10:13.901
we are also providing services

00:10:13.901 --> 00:10:16.937
to people who are on the

00:10:16.937 --> 00:10:17.671
pathway to recovery who MAY not

00:10:17.671 --> 00:10:18.390
be sure what type of support

00:10:18.390 --> 00:10:20.390
they need.

00:10:20.709 --> 00:10:24.145
And we are helping them steer

00:10:24.145 --> 00:10:24.879
them towards treatment.

00:10:24.879 --> 00:10:27.279
For my administration, success

00:10:27.882 --> 00:10:28.650
means helping people regain

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:31.650
their health and stability but

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:32.854
also for our entire community

00:10:32.854 --> 00:10:35.490
to feel safer in san francisco.

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:36.257
I look forward to collaborating

00:10:36.257 --> 00:10:39.270
with you supervisor and all of

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:39.795
your colleagues on a long term

00:10:39.795 --> 00:10:40.495
sustainable approach to address

00:10:40.495 --> 00:10:42.895
our city's fentanyl crisis.

00:10:43.565 --> 00:10:44.232
Thank you so much.

