01:14:54.100 --> 01:14:54.400
Alan was born on DECEMBER 29th,

01:14:54.400 --> 01:14:56.400
1928.

01:14:57.336 --> 01:14:58.400
He grew up in cleveland, ohio

01:14:58.400 --> 01:15:01.400
and earned a bachelor of

01:15:01.400 --> 01:15:01.440
architecture degree from miami

01:15:01.440 --> 01:15:02.142
university.

01:15:02.142 --> 01:15:02.843
He studied at the graduate

01:15:02.843 --> 01:15:05.843
school of design at harvard

01:15:05.912 --> 01:15:06.513
university and earned a

01:15:06.513 --> 01:15:07.280
master's degree in city

01:15:07.280 --> 01:15:09.549
planning from the university of

