01:15:28.201 --> 01:15:28.935
design throughout his life and

01:15:28.935 --> 01:15:31.805
throughout the world working on

01:15:31.805 --> 01:15:32.405
projects in san francisco,

01:15:32.405 --> 01:15:33.106
berkeley, los angeles,

01:15:33.106 --> 01:15:35.106
portland, vancouver, critica

01:15:35.908 --> 01:15:36.776
in brazil and other cities.

01:15:36.776 --> 01:15:39.776
During his tenure as our

01:15:40.180 --> 01:15:40.881
director of city planning from

01:15:40.881 --> 01:15:42.881
1967 to 1975, alan was

01:15:43.917 --> 01:15:44.651
responsible for developing

01:15:44.651 --> 01:15:47.454
major elements of the city's

01:15:47.454 --> 01:15:48.188
